s shedding involved for the  beach filming  number four while most of the makeup was  done digitally for our heroes it didn't  necessarily mean no effort was put in  during filming we now know sonic and his  group of video game characters were made  into physical models the amount of  detail that went into making them this  way was to make it easier to light and  design in post placing them at very  precise angles and heights allowed  artists to light the characters more  accurately in respect to their  environment the only non-animated  character worth mentioning on this one  is dr robotnik jim carrey sports his  iconic stash but not by his own growing  makeup artists made the long whiskers  and simply glued it to his face  number 5 for a lot of the on-screen  actors working with cgi became rather  easy for actor james marston he spent  most of his time talking to thin air the  most coveted safe covet friendly way to  uh to shoot a film luckily for james  he's no stranger to working with  animated co-stars in live-action films  and he got the opportunity to  collaborate with ben during the process  they were shooting all of my stuff first  to be sent back to ben and he would have  to kind of fill in the gaps  number six it's always nice seeing our  favorite stars pass on some love to the  crew and carrie spreads his with a brand  new car he gave one lucky crew member a  brand new chevy blazer rs that's a  pretty expensive one too valued close to  forty thousand dollars we always knew  jim was a stand-up guy to everyone he  worked with and we're not surprised by  this generous act hey if there's any  help you need on your next film sign us  up carrie  number seven due to a global pandemic it  made for quite a cumbersome process it  never really suffered as other  productions did at the time but they  still had to push back a few release  dates so once it came time for them to  finally wrap production they had the  luck of filming the last scene in hawaii  but did they take a little break after  filming a massive blockbuster picture  nope not a minute was wasted for the  post crew they went right into editing  and putting together the best sequel  they could we wouldn't judge though if  they had a pina colada or two before  flying back to the studio number eight  sonic the hedgehog was one of the most  successful video game to film  adaptations so there was no question  that they'd come out with a sequel but  this one isn't going to be your ordinary  film filmmakers wanted it to be even  bigger than before director jeff fowler  had a lot of great material to pull from  for the sequel i mean there's so much  great material to pull from sonic voice  actor ben schwartz gives his stamp of  approval and a couple details on the new  movie saying sonic has some place to  grow sonic has with the scale  number nine as with every release of a  fan favorite franchise the posters have  got to be right and this time creators  may have left a couple of the main cast  out of it the original theatrical poster  released online and fans were furious  that it didn't list two of the main  characters at the top stars tikka sumter  and colleen o'shaughnessy were left out  for unknown reasons thank goodness  they've released the poster with the  much needed corrections and this wasn't  the first time fans got the studio to  change something from the sonic movie  number 10 colleen steps back into a very  comfortable role that she made iconic  and coming back to tales was actually  very easy for her i can easily step into  those shoes this was definitely a  different experience when we saw tales  arrival at the end of the first film we  knew that a team-up was happening and  after seeing him step through the portal  in the sequel's trailer we noticed some  slight changes to his appearance the  color of his fur lightened up a bit and  it got quite the upgrade  number 11 at the soul of these films is  a beating heart of friendship fowler  used this theme to progress sonic's  adventure to new heights i think we  always work really hard on the script to  have that heart in there it was super  important for the cast and crew to build  strong relationships on set that's all  it takes to make a successful sonic  movie and with the cast on board with  this theme it made the film all the more  better when you have the heart and when  you care about what happens to your  characters a movie goes from good to  great number 12. actress tika sumter  didn't get any action in the first film  so she wanted in on some in the second i  said i want two people are active and  they listen now that she got her wish  we're excited to see where she goes in  this one it's a good thing too that  she'll be able to get some stunts in  given she was really stationary before  and she's headstrong that she doesn't  want to go back to her previous  situation first of all don't make me be  on the phone the whole movie and  pregnant or anything number 13 as all  avid video gamers obsess over are those  interesting little easter eggs it's a  great problem to have that there's so  many great easter eggs to kind of  incorporate we were graced with a little  nod to the video games when sonic and  tails fly in the signature biplane from  the original games and a film adaptation  of a video game has got to have them for  the sake of the ultimate fans this movie  is chock full of them i couldn't even  begin to list them number 14 with the  announcement of idris elba joining the  cast as knuckles he wanted to change up  the persona a bit the personal touches  that i try to bring i guess a sense of  humor anyone who knows alba's character  style knows this one's certainly a new  type of approach but he was able to find  some unique aspects of his own  personality and bring it through his  voice acting i would just bring some  oddities to him maybe this was the role  he was always meant for and we just  never realized it you know me i'm i'm  known for being hilarious number 15  carrie seems to be at home living in the  shoes of dr robotnik maybe a little too  comfortably i think robotnik is the  perfect fit for me i am a master jim can  be seen throughout his whole career  playing over the top characters so there  was no question whether he'd take on the  role once again when i get that call  i'll be there especially when it comes  to such a beloved video game villain the  eggman actor just wanted to make the  kids laugh and the adults cry with  nostalgia  i'll be in the way kids laugh when they  want a new jim carrey movie there are a  lot of factors going into the making of  this amazing sequel and with such a  star-studded cast we can be sure it's in  good hands which addition to the roster  of characters are you most excited about  let us know in the comments

